<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Living Wall-->
  <FlyingObject_LivingWall.label>鲜活之壁</FlyingObject_LivingWall.label>
  <!--EN: The awareness brand may be placed on another pawn to increase their vision, hearing, speaking, and intellect.
		
Brands are a semi-permanent form of magic typically created using some form of marking or engraving, much like a magical tattoo, that creates a link between two pawns. Brands require a constant flow of mana to maintain, however, the brand becomes dormant if the caster is unable to sustain the spell. The brand is removed if the caster dies or chooses to dispel the brand.-->
  <TM_AwarenessBrand.description>保护刻印可以授予另一个小人上以提高其听力、视力和意识以及智力。\n刻印是一种半永久性的魔法存在，通常是某种形式的标记或雕刻，就像魔法纹身一样，在两个生物之间建立联系。刻印需要持续的法力来维持，但是，如果施法者无法维持该法术，刻印只会处于休眠状态。如果施法者死亡或选择驱散该刻印，则该刻印将被移除。</TM_AwarenessBrand.description>
  <!--EN: Brand: Awareness-->
  <TM_AwarenessBrand.label>刻印：感知</TM_AwarenessBrand.label>
  <!--EN: Branding is used to create a temporary, magical mark on a pawn that creates a link between the caster and the branded. Multiple brands may be placed on a single pawn as long as each brand is a different type. A caster may create as many brands as they wish, but each brand subtracts from the energy regeneration of the caster. Brands will become dormant if the caster runs out of mana. Brands are a unique type of spell, and each brand must be learned separately. Skill in branding affects all types of brands.-->
  <TM_Branding.description>用于在一个生物上创建一个临时的魔法标记，链接施法者和受印者。一个生物上可以放置多个刻印，当然必须每个刻印的类型不同。一个施法者可以创造任意多的刻印，但每个刻印都会消耗施法者法力再生能力。如果施法者耗尽法力，刻印将处于休眠状态。刻印是一种独特的咒语，每种刻印技能都必须单独学习。刻印技能影响所有类型的刻印。</TM_Branding.description>
  <!--EN: Branding-->
  <TM_Branding.label>刻印</TM_Branding.label>
  <!--EN: Dispels all active brands.-->
  <TM_DispelBranding.description>祛除所有被激活了的刻印。</TM_DispelBranding.description>
  <!--EN: Dispel Brands-->
  <TM_DispelBranding.label>祛除刻印</TM_DispelBranding.label>
  <!--EN: Dispels the living wall.-->
  <TM_DispelLivingWall.description>驱散鲜活之墙。</TM_DispelLivingWall.description>
  <!--EN: Dispel Living Wall-->
  <TM_DispelLivingWall.label>驱散鲜活之墙</TM_DispelLivingWall.label>
  <!--EN: The emotion brand may be placed on another pawn to improve their mood.
		
Brands are a semi-permanent form of magic typically created using some form of marking or engraving, much like a magical tattoo, that creates a link between two pawns. Brands require a constant flow of mana to maintain, however, the brand becomes dormant if the caster is unable to sustain the spell. The brand is removed if the caster dies or chooses to dispel the brand.-->
  <TM_EmotionBrand.description>情感刻印可以授予另一个小人，使他心情愉悦。\n刻印是一种半永久性的魔法存在，通常是某种形式的标记或雕刻，就像魔法纹身一样，在两个生物之间建立联系。刻印需要持续的法力来维持，但是，如果施法者无法维持该法术，刻印只会处于休眠状态。如果施法者死亡或选择驱散该刻印，则该刻印将被移除。</TM_EmotionBrand.description>
  <!--EN: Brand: Emotion-->
  <TM_EmotionBrand.label>刻印：情感</TM_EmotionBrand.label>
  <!--EN: The fitness brand may be placed on another pawn to improve their physical performance.
		
Brands are a semi-permanent form of magic typically created using some form of marking or engraving, much like a magical tattoo, that creates a link between two pawns. Brands require a constant flow of mana to maintain, however, the brand becomes dormant if the caster is unable to sustain the spell. The brand is removed if the caster dies or chooses to dispel the brand.-->
  <TM_FitnessBrand.description>健康刻印可以授予另一个小人上以提高其身体能力。\n刻印是一种半永久性的魔法存在，通常是某种形式的标记或雕刻，就像魔法纹身一样，在两个生物之间建立联系。刻印需要持续的法力来维持，但是，如果施法者无法维持该法术，刻印只会处于休眠状态。如果施法者死亡或选择驱散该刻印，则该刻印将被移除。</TM_FitnessBrand.description>
  <!--EN: Brand: Fitness-->
  <TM_FitnessBrand.label>刻印：健康</TM_FitnessBrand.label>
  <!--EN: Golemancy is the art of infusing magical energy into an object through the use of runes or markings that create a link to the caster. This energy link is commonly used for to achieve the purpose of object animation, energy conversion, or information gathering.

Both the golem and golemancer gain a boost to their capabilities when paired. A golem may only be assigned to one pawn, but multiple golems may be assigned to a single pawn. Golemancy benefits only apply to an assigned golem.

Golems may be crafted from their respective workbenches after the appropriate research is complete. Check the research tab for each golem type and their corresponding workbench.-->
  <TM_Golemancy.description>傀儡学是一门通过使用符文或刻印将魔法能量注入物体的艺术，这些符文或刻印会创造目标与施法者的链接。此能量链接通常用于实现对象活化、能量转换或信息收集的目的。\n当傀儡和傀儡使配对时，他们的能力都会得到提升。一个傀儡只能分配给一个傀儡使，但多个傀儡可以分配给一个傀儡使。傀儡技能的好处只适用于指定的傀儡。</TM_Golemancy.description>
  <!--EN: Golemancy-->
  <TM_Golemancy.label>傀儡学</TM_Golemancy.label>
  <!--EN: Enchants a wall with purpose allowing it to become semi-intelligent. The living wall will strike out at enemies within reach and will repair itself when damaged. The animated creature within the wall may travel to any adjacent section of wall and treats an entire connected section of wall as an extension of itself. A living wall will attempt to move to the closest wall segment of the closest enemy. The living wall cannot move between disconnected wall segments and may only move to another segment that is cardinal adjacent. A caster can only maintain a single living wall, regardless of the size of the wall it occupies. Multiple living wall's may occupy a single wall.-->
  <TM_LivingWall.description>有目的地附魔一堵墙，让它获得正常人一半的智能。这座鲜活之壁将向触手可及的敌人发起攻击，并在受损时自行修复。墙内的生物可以移动到墙的任何相邻部分，并将墙群的整个连接部分视为自身的延伸。鲜活之壁将尝试移动到最靠近敌人的最近墙壁。鲜活之壁不能在断开连接的墙之间移动，只能移动到相邻的另一段墙。一个施法者只能维持一个鲜活之壁，不管它占据的墙有多大。多个鲜活之壁可以占用一个墙。</TM_LivingWall.description>
  <!--EN: Living Wall-->
  <TM_LivingWall.label>鲜活之墙</TM_LivingWall.label>
  <!--EN: The protection brand may be placed on another pawn to absorb attacks. The protection rune recharges periodically.
		
Brands are a semi-permanent form of magic typically created using some form of marking or engraving, much like a magical tattoo, that creates a link between two pawns. Brands require a constant flow of mana to maintain, however, the brand becomes dormant if the caster is unable to sustain the spell. The brand is removed if the caster dies or chooses to dispel the brand.-->
  <TM_ProtectionBrand.description>保护刻印可以授予另一个小人上以吸收攻击。保护刻印会定期自我充能。\n刻印是一种半永久性的魔法存在，通常是某种形式的标记或雕刻，就像魔法纹身一样，在两个生物之间建立联系。刻印需要持续的法力来维持，但是，如果施法者无法维持该法术，刻印只会处于休眠状态。如果施法者死亡或选择驱散该刻印，则该刻印将被移除。</TM_ProtectionBrand.description>
  <!--EN: Brand: Protection-->
  <TM_ProtectionBrand.label>刻印：保护</TM_ProtectionBrand.label>
  <!--EN: Rune carving is a magical art used to permanently instill magical power into an object. This process has long been performed to inscribe runes into equipment and weapons to bestow magical properties. The Golemancer uses a similar, but more delicate, process using runes to increase the efficacy of bodyparts. While only specific parts may be enhanced through rune carving, any variation of those parts can be enhanced. 

Rune carving requires additional material resources in a marked stockpile: 225 magicyte, 2 mana potions, and 1 medicine. Successful rune carving is determined by the golemancer's skill in crafting, art, and ability skill. Medical work must also be enabled for the caster since rune carving is a form of a medical operation. Rune carving will never be successful if either crafting or artistic skill is disabled.

To apply runes, select the pawn you wish to inscribe and create the rune carving surgery under their health options. All components must be available before the surgery option will appear.-->
  <TM_RuneCarving.description>符文雕刻是一种魔法艺术，用于永久性地向物体灌输魔法力量。这一过程长期以来一直被用来在装备和武器上刻符文以赋予魔法属性。傀儡使使用类似但更精细的符文来提高身体部位的能力。虽然只有特定的部分可以通过符文雕刻得到增强，但这些部分的任何变化都可以得到增强。\n符文雕刻需要额外的材料：225个魔法原石，2个法力药剂和1个药物。成功的符文雕刻取决于傀儡使的制作、艺术和符文雕刻技能。由于符文雕刻是一种医疗操作，施法者也必须启用医疗工作。如果制作或艺术技能无法使用，符文雕刻将永远不会成功。</TM_RuneCarving.description>
  <!--EN: Rune Carving-->
  <TM_RuneCarving.label>符文雕刻</TM_RuneCarving.label>
  <!--EN: Activating this ability causes all brands to invert their effects, granting bonuses to the caster instead of the branded. This ability causes moderate pain to the branded and bonuses to the caster for each brand they control. Use this ability again to stop draining.-->
  <TM_SigilDrain.description>激活此能力会使所有刻印反转效果，使其给予施法者加成而不是受印者。这个技能会对受印者造成中度疼痛，并对其控制的每个刻印的施法者产生加成。再次使用此能力停止枯竭。</TM_SigilDrain.description>
  <!--EN: Sigil Drain-->
  <TM_SigilDrain.label>刻印枯竭</TM_SigilDrain.label>
  <!--EN: Activating this ability causes all brands to become super-charged. This ability causes moderate pain to the Golemancer and triples the energy drain of each brand. Use the ability again to stop surging.-->
  <TM_SigilSurge.description>激活此能力会使所有刻印都变为“汹涌”状态。这种能力会给傀儡使带来中度疼痛，并使每个刻印的能量消耗增加三倍。再次使用该能力停止汹涌。</TM_SigilSurge.description>
  <!--EN: Sigil Surge-->
  <TM_SigilSurge.label>刻印汹涌</TM_SigilSurge.label>
  <!--EN: The siphon brand may be placed on another mage to periodically transfer their mana to the caster.
		
Brands are a semi-permanent form of magic typically created using some form of marking or engraving, much like a magical tattoo, that creates a link between two pawns. Brands require a constant flow of mana to maintain, however, the brand becomes dormant if the caster is unable to sustain the spell. The brand is removed if the caster dies or chooses to dispel the brand.-->
  <TM_SiphonBrand.description>虹吸刻印可以授予另一个法师，使其定期将法力转移给施法者。\n刻印是一种半永久性的魔法存在，通常是某种形式的标记或雕刻，就像魔法纹身一样，在两个生物之间建立联系。刻印需要持续的法力来维持，但是，如果施法者无法维持该法术，刻印只会处于休眠状态。如果施法者死亡或选择驱散该刻印，则该刻印将被移除。</TM_SiphonBrand.description>
  <!--EN: Brand: Siphon-->
  <TM_SiphonBrand.label>刻印：虹吸</TM_SiphonBrand.label>
  <!--EN: The vitality brand may be placed on another pawn to improve their overall health, healing, and disease resistance.
		
Brands are a semi-permanent form of magic typically created using some form of marking or engraving, much like a magical tattoo, that creates a link between two pawns. Brands require a constant flow of mana to maintain, however, the brand becomes dormant if the caster is unable to sustain the spell. The brand is removed if the caster dies or chooses to dispel the brand.-->
  <TM_VitalityBrand.description>生命刻印可以授予另一个小人，以提高其整体健康、愈合和抗病能力。\n刻印是一种半永久性的魔法存在，通常是某种形式的标记或雕刻，就像魔法纹身一样，在两个生物之间建立联系。刻印需要持续的法力来维持，但是，如果施法者无法维持该法术，刻印只会处于休眠状态。如果施法者死亡或选择驱散该刻印，则该刻印将被移除。</TM_VitalityBrand.description>
  <!--EN: Brand: Vitality-->
  <TM_VitalityBrand.label>刻印：生命</TM_VitalityBrand.label>
</LanguageData>
